# preflight green, with a figure published in README that exists in no artefact.
#
# The fix is NOT a better joiner. Any joiner is one re-pairing away from the same defect,
# because joining is what changes which backticks pair. Each prose file is now read TWICE
# -- as written, and joined -- and the figures are the UNION, which no arrangement of line
# breaks can subtract from. This artefact is that fix failing to be unnecessary: it is the
# gate RED on the attack, which is the only evidence that the union leg does anything.
